==Battleground==
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Rin Tohsaka (Enemy)|Rin Tohsaka]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

